00:07:44.305 --> 00:07:45.291
You've got five people to interview

00:07:45.291 --> 00:07:47.333
and you hire one of those people.

00:07:47.333 --> 00:07:49.619
But that just took eight hours, didn't it?

00:07:49.619 --> 00:07:51.375
And that my friends,

00:07:51.375 --> 00:07:53.348
is how you actually do it.

00:07:53.348 --> 00:07:55.310
Because everybody's
looking for quick tactics

00:07:55.310 --> 00:07:57.607
